  C6('c-colour','It is snowing heavily. Which ball colour is easiest to see?',['Classic snowy white','Bright traffic-cone orange','Soft cloudy grey'],1,'Yes! Orange stands out against snow, while white disappears.','White and grey blend into snow. A bright orange ball is much easier to follow.'),
  C6('c-size','Which ball size do adult players use?',['Size 3, the little one','Size 4, the middle one','Size 5, the big one'],2,'Right! Adults use a size 5, about 68 to 70 centimetres around.','Sizes 3 and 4 are for younger players. Adults use size 5.'),
  C6('c-flat','Why do referees check the ball before kick-off?',['To make sure it meets the Laws','To pick which team kicks off','To sign it'],0,'Exactly! The referee checks the ball is the right size, weight and pressure.','The ball check is about making sure it meets the Laws, not choosing ends or autographs.')
