  T6('boot-off','What if my boot comes off during play?','Put it back on at the next stoppage. Playing on without one is not a good idea for safety.'),
  T6('bib-pile','Why are training bibs always smelly?','Twenty sweaty players, one bag! I wash them after every session and dry them in the sun.','Why do teams use bibs?','Bibs split a squad into two sides in seconds, so training games can start straight away.')
